  m_Name: VY_TempleWorkers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  startingNodeID: Request
  nodes:
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Request
    nextNodeID: Location
    text: 'Place the urn at the head of the table please, sister. '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Father
    leftSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Location
    nextNodeID: Answer
    text: Have you found the marker for the pit where the wine has been stored?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Father
    leftSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Answer
    nextNodeID: Pleased
    text: Yes, father.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Sister
    leftSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Pleased
    nextNodeID: WineInfo
    text: Lord Dionysus will be pleased with us, then, in spite of the hard year.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Father
    leftSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: WineInfo
    nextNodeID: Blessing
    text: "The wine there has been aging since last year\u2019s harvest, and it will
      not be so weak as the libations made this year."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Father
    leftSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Blessing
    nextNodeID: Location
    text: Perhaps we can earn the favor of Dionysus Birseus, he who prevails, and
      overcome our troubles with his blessing.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Father
    leftSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: Location
    nextNodeID: 
    text: A pit? The wine I'm looking for must be located back of the temple, hidden.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
